### 1. Get Published Events (Public)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/events?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create Event (Requires Admin/Organizer Auth)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

